"""Original static attention lesson. No network, models, state or dependencies."""
from pathlib import Path


def render(root):
    for en in (False, True):
        def t(zh, english):
            return english if en else zh
        academy = 'academy-en.html' if en else 'academy.html'
        other = 'attention-lab.html' if en else 'attention-lab-en.html'
        title = t('Attention 实验台：从分数到输出', 'Attention lab: from scores to output')
        html = f'''<!doctype html><html lang="{'en' if en else 'zh-CN'}"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self'; connect-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'"><title>{title} · ModelAtlas</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="academy.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="attention-lab.css"><script src="attention-math.js" defer></script><script src="attention-lab.js" defer></script></head>
<body class="academy-page"><main class="academy lab"><header><a href="{academy}#tokens">← {t('返回 token 与 attention 章', 'Back to tokens and attention')}</a><a href="{other}" lang="{'zh-CN' if en else 'en'}">{t('English', '中文')}</a></header><p class="academy-eyebrow">MODELATLAS · {t('机制实验 / 原创教学', 'MECHANISM LAB / ORIGINAL LESSON')}</p><h1>{title}</h1>
<p>{t('前置：会做加权平均，读过 token 与 attention 章。目标：亲手核对缩放、softmax 和加权输出，并解释因果遮罩如何改变可见位置。', 'Prerequisites: weighted averages and the token/attention chapter. Goal: verify scaling, softmax and weighted output, then explain how a causal mask changes visible positions.')}</p>
<p class="warning">{t('这里只演示数学。T1、T2、T3 是固定教学 token 标签，不是真实分词；分数由作者指定，不是模型学到的参数。没有训练、语义理解、模型实测或因果解释证明。无 API、外部调用、下载或学习记录存储。', 'This demonstrates mathematics only. T1, T2 and T3 are fixed teaching token labels, not real tokenization. Scores are supplied by the author, not learned model parameters. No training, semantic understanding, model benchmark or proof of causal explanation. No API, external calls, downloads or progress storage.')}</p>
<section><h2>1 · {t('先明确输入', 'Inspect the inputs')}</h2><p>{t('为聚焦后半段计算，我们直接给定点积分数 QKᵀ，不计算 Q/K 投影。键维度 dₖ = 4，故除以 √4 = 2。V 是三个标量 [2, 6, 10]（dᵥ = 1）。行对应查询位置，列对应键位置。ln 表示自然对数。', 'To focus on the later steps, we supply dot-product scores QKᵀ directly; Q/K projections are not computed. Key dimension dₖ = 4, so divide by √4 = 2. V contains three scalars [2, 6, 10] (dᵥ = 1). Rows are query positions; columns are key positions. ln means natural logarithm.')}</p>
<pre><code>          T1       T2        T3
QKᵀ = [ [  0,    2 ln 2,   2 ln 3 ],
        [  2,       0,       −2    ],
        [  0,       0,        0    ] ]
V = [2, 6, 10]</code></pre>
<p class="equation">sⱼ = (qᵢ · kⱼ) / √dₖ<br>wⱼ = exp(sⱼ − m) / Σₗ∈A exp(sₗ − m), m = maxₗ∈A sₗ<br>yᵢ = Σⱼ wⱼ Vⱼ</p>
<p>{t('A 是可见位置集合：无遮罩时全部可见；因果遮罩只允许 j ≤ i（包括自己）。不可见位置权重为 0，相当于在 softmax 前将其分数设为 −∞。先减去可见分数最大值 m，不改变权重，可避免指数上溢；不是改变 attention 的温度。', 'A is the visible set: all positions without masking; j ≤ i, including the query itself, with the causal mask. Hidden positions get weight 0, equivalent to a −∞ score before softmax. Subtracting the largest visible score m preserves weights and prevents exponential overflow; it does not change attention temperature.')}</p></section>
<section><h2>2 · {t('改变一个条件，检查整条链', 'Change one condition, inspect the chain')}</h2><p>{t('先看 T1 / 无遮罩，再开启遮罩；最后选择 T2、T3。不要把权重当作下一个 token 的预测概率。', 'Start with T1 / no mask, then enable the mask; finally select T2 and T3. These weights are not next-token prediction probabilities.')}</p>
<div class="lab-controls"><label for="query">{t('查询位置', 'Query position')}<select id="query"><option value="0">T1</option><option value="1">T2</option><option value="2">T3</option></select></label><label for="causal"><input id="causal" type="checkbox">{t('启用因果遮罩', 'Enable causal mask')}</label><button id="reset" type="button">{t('重置实验', 'Reset experiment')}</button></div>
<noscript><p class="warning">{t('交互需要 JavaScript。下面的手算与解答仍可离线阅读；启用脚本后重载可恢复交互。', 'Interaction needs JavaScript. The hand calculation and explanation below remain readable offline; enable scripts and reload to restore interaction.')}</p></noscript>
<p id="error" role="alert"></p><div id="result" hidden><div class="lab-table" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="{t('可横向滚动的计算表', 'Horizontally scrollable calculation table')}"><table><caption>{t('每个键位置的计算；宽表可横向滚动', 'Calculation by key position; scroll horizontally for all columns')}</caption><thead><tr>{''.join('<th scope="col">'+x+'</th>' for x in [t('键','Key'),t('给定点积','Given dot'),t('遮罩前分数 s','Score s before mask'),t('可见性','Visibility'),'exp(s − m)',t('权重 w','Weight w'),'V','w × V'])}</tr></thead><tbody id="rows"></tbody></table></div><p id="normalizer"></p><p id="summary" class="lab-output" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div></section>
<section><h2>3 · {t('先手算，再自检', 'Hand-calculate, then check')}</h2><p>{t('已知结果（T1，无遮罩）：缩放分数为 [0, ln 2, ln 3]；未平移的指数为 [1, 2, 3]，总和为 6。因此权重为 [1/6, 2/6, 3/6]，输出 = 2/6 + 12/6 + 30/6 = 22/3 ≈ 7.333333。表中使用减最大值后的指数 [1/3, 2/3, 1]，权重不变。', 'Known result (T1, no mask): scaled scores are [0, ln 2, ln 3]; unshifted exponentials are [1, 2, 3], summing to 6. Weights are [1/6, 2/6, 3/6], so output = 2/6 + 12/6 + 30/6 = 22/3 ≈ 7.333333. The table uses shifted exponentials [1/3, 2/3, 1]; weights are unchanged.')}</p>
<p>{t('预测题（固定场景，与当前控件选择无关）：T1 开启因果遮罩后，输出是多少？', 'Prediction (fixed scenario, independent of current controls): what is the output for T1 with the causal mask enabled?')}</p><div class="lab-controls"><label for="answer">{t('你的数值答案', 'Your numeric answer')}<input id="answer" type="number" min="-10000" max="10000" step="any" inputmode="decimal" aria-describedby="feedback"></label><button id="check" type="button">{t('核对答案', 'Check answer')}</button></div><p id="feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<details><summary>{t('解答、解释与下一次尝试', 'Answer, explanation and next attempt')}</summary><p>{t('输出是 2。只剩 T1 可见，权重是 [1, 0, 0]。不能先对三个位置做 softmax 再直接把未来权重置零，否则权重和不再为 1。下一次选择 T3：分数相同，三个位置都可见，权重都是 1/3，输出为 6；开启遮罩结果不变。若答案不对，先检查可见集合，再检查归一化分母，最后重算加权和。', 'The output is 2. Only T1 is visible, with weights [1, 0, 0]. Do not softmax over all three and then merely zero future weights: they would no longer sum to 1. Next select T3: equal scores and all three positions visible give weights 1/3 and output 6; enabling the mask changes nothing. If your answer is wrong, inspect visibility, then the normalization denominator, then the weighted sum.')}</p></details>
<p>{t('恢复：空白或非法答案不会进入计算。清空重填即可；“重置实验”恢复 T1 / 无遮罩并清除答案。语言切换通过链接保留查询位置、遮罩和合法数值答案，但须重新核对；非法答案不传递。未计算结果不显示为成功，脚本失败可重载页面或继续阅读手算。', 'Recovery: blank or invalid answers never enter the calculation. Clear and re-enter; Reset experiment restores T1 / no mask and clears the answer. Language links preserve query, mask and valid numeric answers, but require a fresh answer check; invalid answers are not carried over. Uncomputed results are not shown as success. If scripts fail, reload or continue with the hand calculation.')}</p></section>
<section><h2>4 · {t('解释边界，继续学习', 'Explain the limits, continue learning')}</h2><p>{t('完成检查点：用自己的话解释缩放、为何权重和为 1、为什么 T1 不能读取未来。真实 Transformer 还含学习到的投影、多头、位置机制、残差和前馈层；这里没有实现它们，也没有训练损失、梯度或采样循环。权重大小不能证明语义、答案真实性或因果关系。这个小实验不是完整课程验收。', 'Checkpoint: explain scaling, why weights sum to 1, and why T1 cannot read future positions. A real Transformer also includes learned projections, multiple heads, positional mechanisms, residual paths and feed-forward layers; none is implemented here. Neither are training loss, gradients or sampling. Weight size does not prove semantics, truth or causality. This small lab is not completion of the whole course.')}</p><p class="source">{t('数学依据：', 'Mathematical source: ')}<a href="https://arxiv.org/html/1706.03762v7#S3.SS2.SSS1">Vaswani et al., Attention Is All You Need · §3.2.1, Eq. (1)</a>; <a href="https://arxiv.org/html/1706.03762v7#S3.SS2.SSS3">§3.2.3 {t('解码器遮罩', 'decoder masking')}</a>. {t('原论文 2017；所核对 v7 日期 2023-08-02；本次数学核对 2026-11-01。此日期不更新站内历史事实日期。给定数值、教学步骤和稳定实现为本站原创。', 'Original paper: 2017; checked version v7: 2023-08-02; mathematics checked: 2026-11-01. This does not refresh historical fact dates elsewhere. Numerical fixtures, lesson steps and stable implementation are original to this site.')}</p><p><a href="attention-math.js">{t('查看计算源码（JavaScript）', 'Read calculation source (JavaScript)')}</a> · <a href="{academy}#tools">{t('下一步：工具与记忆的边界', 'Next: tool and memory boundaries')} →</a></p></section></main></body></html>'''
        (root / 'web' / ('attention-lab-en.html' if en else 'attention-lab.html')).write_text(html)

if __name__ == '__main__':
    render(Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1])
